## 11. Scenario Link Pattern

Many IB-style questions are scenario-based.

To link to the scenario, mention the actual people, organization, system, data, or problem.

### Weak Answer

```text
It is secure.
```

### Stronger Scenario Answer

```text
Encryption protects patient records during transmission, reducing the risk that attackers intercept sensitive medical data.
```

This is stronger because it mentions:

```text
encryption
patient records
transmission
attackers intercept
sensitive medical data
```

### Scenario Link Prompts

Use phrases like:

```text
In this organization...
For the hospital...
For the student records...
For employees working remotely...
For the online shop...
For the machine learning model...
```

