## 12. Common Weak Answer Patterns

| Weak Pattern | Why It Loses Marks | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| "It is better" | too vague | say how/why better |
| "It is faster" | no context | faster at what? |
| "It is secure" | no mechanism | explain encryption/access control/authentication |
| "It saves money" | no detail | say what cost is reduced |
| "It is easy" | too general | say easier for whom and why |
| "The computer does it" | not technical | name the process/system |
| "Data is safe" | vague | explain backup, encryption, access control |
| "AI learns" | too broad | explain data, model, training, prediction |
| "Database connects tables" | incomplete | mention primary/foreign keys |
| "Loop repeats" | incomplete | mention condition/counter |

