## 13. Self-marking Routine

After writing an answer, students should ask:

```text
Did I answer the command term?
Did I include the required number of points?
Did I expand each point enough?
Did I use technical vocabulary?
Did I link to the scenario?
Did I avoid repeating the same point?
Did I avoid vague words like good, bad, easy, better?
Did I check if the marks match my answer depth?
```

### Correction Routine

When correcting:

```text
1. Highlight marks earned.
2. Underline missing keyword.
3. Add one scenario link.
4. Rewrite one vague sentence.
5. Compare improved answer with mark scheme.
```

