## 19. Common Exam Practice Mistakes

| Mistake | Example | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| Ignoring command term | explain question answered as list | add reason/effect |
| No scenario link | generic answer only | mention given organization/data/user |
| Repeating same point | "secure" said twice | use different methods |
| Vague benefit | "it is useful" | specify benefit |
| No expansion | one-word answer for 2 marks | add how/why |
| Misusing terms | RAM vs storage confused | review definitions |
| Not tracing fully | final output guessed | use trace table |
| SQL syntax incomplete | missing FROM/WHERE | check SQL structure |
| Long answer has no conclusion | discuss/evaluate incomplete | add supported judgement |
| Coding answer has no output/return | method incomplete | check requirement |

