## 20. Exam Answer Templates

### Definition Template

```text
[Term] is [precise meaning].
```

Example:

```text
A foreign key is a field in one table that refers to the primary key in another table.
```

### Outline Template

```text
[Point]. This means [brief expansion].
```

### Explain Template

```text
[Point] because [reason/how]. This leads to [effect in scenario].
```

### Compare Template

```text
Both [A] and [B] ...
However, [A] ... whereas [B] ...
In this scenario, ...
```

### Discuss Template

```text
One advantage is ...
However, one disadvantage is ...
Another issue is ...
Overall, ...
```

### Algorithm Template

```text
INPUT ...
INITIALIZE ...
LOOP / IF ...
UPDATE ...
OUTPUT ...
```

### SQL Template

```sql
SELECT field1, field2
FROM tableName
WHERE condition
ORDER BY field ASC;
```

